NOTE: The PROCEDURE REG printed page 1003.

12989      data USPopulation;
12990      input Population @@;
12991      retain Year 1780;
12992      Year = Year+10;
12993      YearSq = Year *Year;
12994      Population = Population/1000;
12995      datalines;

NOTE: SAS went to a new line when INPUT statement reached past the end of a line.
NOTE: The data set WORK.USPOPULATION has 22 observations and 3 variables.

12999      ;
13000      proc reg data=USPopulation plots=ResidualByPredicted;
13001      var YearSq;
13002      model Population=Year / r clm cli;
13003      run;

WARNING: You must enable ODS graphics before requesting plots with the PLOTS option in the PROC REG statement.
13004      add YearSq;
13005      print;
13006      run;

NOTE: Variable YearSq is added.
NOTE: Due to an ADD statement, the model label is now MODEL1.1.

NOTE: The PROCEDURE REG printed pages 1004-1007.

13007      proc reg data=USPopulation plots=predictions(X=Year);
13008      model Population=Year Yearsq;
13009      quit;

